{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S03、S08、S10、S11、S12等较短段落中感受词出现得比较密，纵向交替又需要上下寻找，容易来不及扫完；Y的左右分栏和短词排列更便于快速浏览。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然信息更多，但高亮词能迅速抓住每段叙事的关键转折，感受又能跟着音乐实际发生的时刻出现，听觉和画面的对应关系更具体。尤其人物从不甘心、怀念、孤独、反复犹疑到不再逼自己选边的心理变化，X呈现出了更清楚的递进，音乐中的音色、节奏、织体变化也提供了细腻而有辨识度的感受。Y更容易一眼扫过，但右侧短词经常只是并列罗列，容易知道这里有什么情绪，却不容易感受到这些情绪怎样发生、怎样变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f71049f1-1542-4816-aca4-424bb9d62208", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T154734059946Z", "elapsed_seconds": 95.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:49:09.624226+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7673c15fe434137313da46a74a7ed1b7835748d1f701442b1c3d0b147cb3c620", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa